Package: nfwpunch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: Aleksei Ilin <a@a-ilin.dev>
Description: HTTP server of a ZIP file contents
 *nfwpunch* is a dynamic firewall hole punching daemon for nftables.

 It allows to expose a service running on a private network to the public Internet by creating temporary firewall rules for incoming connections.
 The daemon may be called by Nginx or Apache web server after a user is authorized.
